            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Oyster Bay Sailing Club Courses</strong></div><div><table class=\"q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name of course</th><th>What you learn</th><th>Cost</th><th>Other information</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Taster day</td><td>introduction to sailing</td><td>£120 if booking one place</td><td>small groups (max {{1}} people)</td></tr><tr><td>Level 1</td><td>basic theory e.g. understanding the {{2}} and tides<br>basic sailing skills including {{3}} information</td><td>£200<br>a {{4}} available for club members<br>all inclusive (plus a useful {{5}})</td><td> {{6}} at the end of the course for all participants</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
